// Serverminate (RvsB-only copy of Terminate, hidden, not in any factory/reconstructor; RvsB evolves dp-destroy-unit into this).
// Same stats, sprites, strain and nozzles as Terminate, but fully self-contained: own statuses (dp-serverminate-strain-1..9,
// dp-serverminate-dash) and sprites, so it loads on servers without Terminate. The difference is how the dash reaches the player:
// - Dash mounts 0-2 no longer apply the dash buff themselves. Their lance bullet spawns dp-serverminate-dash-trigger
//   (spawnBullets), a missile unit that dies after 5 ticks. Clients never spawn units, so the client never gets the buff early.
// - The plugin (game/units/special/Serverminate.java) sees the trigger, finds its shooter and applies dp-serverminate-dash
//   (x6.3 move speed, 18 ticks) on the server right before the next entity snapshot, so the client gets the buff with its
//   full duration. AI-controlled Serverminates get it immediately.
// - The lance is unchanged and fires right away (also while idle), like Terminate's.
// - The plugin moves the server copy toward the client position at up to 2x dash speed for the dash + 0.15 s, limited by a
//   per-dash budget (dash distance from the pre-buff speed), so strict mode doesn't snap the player back.
